WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.869
INVESTIGATIVE JOURNALIST JOHN
SWEENEY IS ALL TOO FAMILIAR

00:00:02.869 --> 00:00:05.705
WITH PUTIN'S TACTICS AND IS OUT
WITH A NEW BOOK ON THE RUSSIAN

00:00:05.705 --> 00:00:07.207
LEADER CALLED KILLER IN THE
KREMLIN.

00:00:07.207 --> 00:00:10.743
HE JOINS ME NOW.
WELCOME TO THE PROGRAM, JOHN.

00:00:10.743 --> 00:00:14.380
THIS ISN'T THE FIRST TIME WE
ARE TALKING ABOUT POTENTIAL

00:00:14.380 --> 00:00:16.683
CATASTROPHE AT THE ZAPORIZHZHIA
POWER PLANT.

00:00:16.683 --> 00:00:19.652
A FEW MONTHS AGO, THERE HAD
BEEN SHELLING AROUND THE PLANT

00:00:19.652 --> 00:00:24.724
AS WELL AND THE I EAT --
IAEA HAD BEEN SOUNDING ALARMS

00:00:24.724 --> 00:00:25.792
AS WELL.
WHY DO YOU THINK RUSSIA

00:00:25.792 --> 00:00:30.363
CONTINUES TO MAKE SUCH
DANGEROUS STEPS THAT COULD NOT

00:00:30.363 --> 00:00:33.666
ONLY IMPACT UKRAINE, OBVIOUSLY,
BUT EUROPE AT LARGE?

00:00:33.666 --> 00:00:39.405
&gt;&gt; YOU'VE GONE --
GOT TO UNDERSTAND, BIANNA, THAT

00:00:39.405 --> 00:00:42.875
VLADIMIR PUTIN HAS BEEN, AS A
TEENAGER, SOMETHING WHEN HE WAS

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:46.579
LIKE 12, HE FOUND A MENTOR WHO
CHANGED HIS LIFE.

00:00:46.579 --> 00:00:51.751
THIS MENTOR WAS A GANGSTER.
WHEN HE RAN A MIXED MARTIAL

00:00:51.751 --> 00:00:55.822
ARTS CLUB, WHICH PUTIN WENT TO
IN ST. PETERSBURG.

00:00:55.822 --> 00:01:00.693
AND WHEN THIS MENTOR DIED, ON
HIS GRAVESTONE THE PHRASE WAS,

00:01:00.693 --> 00:01:04.197
I AM DEAD BUT THE MATTER IS A
MORTAL.

00:01:04.197 --> 00:01:08.735
WHEN DEALING WITH THE CRIME
BOSS OF THE GAMBIAN O FAMILY,

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:13.640
OR SOMEBODY LIKE THIS, AND WHAT
HE LIKES TO DO, AND THIS IS

00:01:13.640 --> 00:01:18.745
ABSOLUTELY PART OF HIS PLAYBOOK,
IS TO THREATEN TERRIFYING

00:01:18.745 --> 00:01:20.914
VIOLENCE.
ONE OF THE THINGS THAT EUROPE

00:01:20.914 --> 00:01:24.751
AND THE WHOLE WORLD IS AFRAID
OF IS SOME CORN OF NUCLEAR

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:28.388
DISASTER.
SO I THINK WHAT IS HAPPENING IN

00:01:28.388 --> 00:01:31.758
REALITY IS THAT THE RUSSIANS
AND THE RUSSIAN ARMY, THE

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:33.927
RUSSIAN KILLING MACHINE, IS
FAILING.

00:01:33.927 --> 00:01:39.832
IT'S NOT DOING VERY WELL.
THEY REVERSED OUT OF THE BATTLE

00:01:39.832 --> 00:01:43.736
OF KYIV, THEY LOST THAT.
THEN THEY WENT TO THE EAST AND

00:01:43.736 --> 00:01:49.375
GOT THE LUGANSK REGION, THAT'S
TRUE, BUT IT COST AN AWFUL LOT

00:01:49.375 --> 00:01:53.613
OF RUSSIAN BLOOD AND PRESSURE.
THEY HAVE NOT YET SECURED THE

00:01:53.613 --> 00:01:56.783
DONETSK OBLAST IN ITS ENTIRETY.
AND YET --

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.919
THE CRANIUM HAVE MADE THEM
FIGHT VERY, VERY HARD FOR THAT.

00:01:59.919 --> 00:02:04.690
BUT THEN, THE AMERICAN
LONG-RANGE ROCKET LAUNCHER, A

00:02:04.690 --> 00:02:10.396
HIGH MARKS SYSTEM, I THINK HAS
CHANGED THE GAME AND HAS

00:02:10.396 --> 00:02:12.765
BLASTED THESE 12 MAJOR RUSSIAN
AMMO DUMPS.

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:19.772
SO WHAT I THINK WE ARE LOOKING
AT IS PUTIN TRYING TO FRIGHTEN

00:02:19.772 --> 00:02:22.708
THE WORLD AND EUROPE BY SAYING
WE CAN SHELL THESE PLACES.

00:02:22.708 --> 00:02:26.746
NOW PRACTICALLY, THESE NUCLEAR
POWER STATIONS ARE VERY, VERY

00:02:26.746 --> 00:02:29.382
STRONGLY BUILT.
I KNOW ABOUT CHERNOBYL, YES,

00:02:29.382 --> 00:02:34.453
I'VE WRITTEN ABOUT IN MY BOOK,
BUT THAT WAS A MASSIVE INTERNAL

00:02:34.453 --> 00:02:40.760
DISASTER, BECAUSE THE ORIGINAL
DESIGN OF THE REACTOR WAS WRONG,

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:43.396
AND THE SOVIETS KNOW ABOUT IT,
AND THEY SUPPRESSED IT RATHER

00:02:43.396 --> 00:02:45.732
THAN TACKLING IT.
THAT IS A PROBLEM WITH THIS

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:50.970
KIND OF SYSTEM.
&gt;&gt; ANY SYSTEM, I WOULD IMAGINE,

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:56.743
WOULD NOT BE BUILT TO SUSTAIN
CONTINUED ROCKET ATTACKS.

00:02:56.743 --> 00:03:01.914
NO ONE WOULD IMAGINE THAT THERE
WOULD BE A WAR ENSUING WHERE

00:03:01.914 --> 00:03:07.720
YOU HAVE RUSSIAN TROOPS, NOT
ONLY INFILTRATE THE FACILITY,

00:03:07.720 --> 00:03:13.960
BUT ALSO IT APPEARS NOW
FOCUSING ON, STRATEGICALLY AT

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:19.899
LEAST AS YOU ARE SAYING, TO
GARNER THE THREAT TOWARDS THE

00:03:19.899 --> 00:03:21.534
REST OF THE WORLD, ATTEMPTS TO
SABOTAGE NUCLEAR FACILITY.

00:03:21.534 --> 00:03:26.239
&gt;&gt; YES, BUT WHAT HE'S DOING IS
TRYING TO GENERATE FEAR.

00:03:26.239 --> 00:03:30.510
THAT IS HIS PLAYBOOK.
DO NOT MESS WITH ME.

00:03:30.510 --> 00:03:33.112
AS I SAY, OR YOU WILL SUFFER.
&gt;&gt; IS IT WORKING?

00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:40.620
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK THE UKRAINIAN
ARMY BEG TO DIFFER.

00:03:40.620 --> 00:03:43.823
THE UKRAINIAN ARMY AND THE
UKRAINIAN PEOPLE ARE SAYING, WE

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.792
KNOW WHO YOU ARE, WE KNOW WHAT
YOU ARE LIKE, AND WE ARE

00:03:45.792 --> 00:03:48.328
STANDING UP TO YOU.
OBVIOUSLY, THIS IS KIND OF

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:51.731
WARNING, BUT THERE'S A NUMBER
OF REASONS SET OUT IN MY BOOK

00:03:51.731 --> 00:04:00.373
THAT I THINK VLADIMIR PUTIN IS
A FRAGILE MONSTER, AND I DON'T

00:04:00.373 --> 00:04:02.909
THINK THAT HIS STRATEGY IS
WORKING.

00:04:02.909 --> 00:04:07.513
I THINK IT'S A CATASTROPHIC
MISTAKE FOR HUMANITY, FOR

00:04:07.513 --> 00:04:10.350
UKRAINE, FOR RUSSIA, BUT ALSO
FOR VLADIMIR PUTIN'S GRIP ON

00:04:10.350 --> 00:04:11.684
POWER.
LET ME TAKE YOU THROUGH SOME OF

00:04:11.684 --> 00:04:14.654
THOSE REASONS.
FIRST OF WHICH IS ALEXEI

00:04:14.654 --> 00:04:17.757
NAVALNY, WHO'S THE EFFECTIVE
LEADER OF THE OPPOSITION.

00:04:17.757 --> 00:04:20.727
HE'S LOCKED UP.
HE'S A GREAT CRITIC OF PUTIN.

00:04:20.727 --> 00:04:24.731
HE'S A GREAT CRITIC OF THE WAR.
AND YET, HE IS STILL ALIVE.

00:04:24.731 --> 00:04:27.867
VLADIMIR PUTIN COULD KILL HIM
LIKE THAT, BUT WHY NOT?

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:31.704
BECAUSE VLADIMIR PUTIN IS
AFRAID OF HAVING HIM KILLED IN

00:04:31.704 --> 00:04:35.474
PRISON.
BECAUSE HE FEARS THAT PEOPLE IN

00:04:35.474 --> 00:04:37.910
MOSCOW AND ST. PETERSBURG WILL
RISE UP AND SAY, WHAT ARE YOU

00:04:37.910 --> 00:04:42.482
DOING?
&gt;&gt; CAN I JUST PUSH BACK ON THAT?

00:04:42.482 --> 00:04:45.318
&gt;&gt; YES.
&gt;&gt; EVEN NAVALNY'S OWN TEAM HAD

00:04:45.318 --> 00:04:49.288
SAID, AS SOON AS THIS WAR BEGAN,
THAT NAVALNY'S LIFE WAS AT HIS

00:04:49.288 --> 00:04:52.225
GREATEST RISK YET SINCE BEING
ARRESTED ONCE RETURNING TO

00:04:52.225 --> 00:04:53.459
RUSSIA.
IF THERE WAS EVER A TIME FOR

00:04:53.459 --> 00:04:56.362
HIM TO BE KILLED IN PRISON, IT
WOULD BE THEN.

00:04:56.362 --> 00:04:59.198
THEY ALSO DID NOT BELIEVE THAT
VLADIMIR PUTIN WOULD GO THIS

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:04.003
FAR AND INVADE UKRAINE.
AND THAT HAVING BEEN SAID, WHEN

00:05:04.003 --> 00:05:06.272
YOU ARE TALKING ABOUT THE
PEOPLE ON THE STREETS OF MOSCOW

00:05:06.272 --> 00:05:11.010
AND LENINGRAD REVOLTING, IN
OUTRAGE, YES THEY CAME OUT IN

00:05:11.010 --> 00:05:13.346
SUPPORT FOR HIM WHEN HE CAME
BACK TO RUSSIA, BUT WE DON'T

00:05:13.346 --> 00:05:15.581
SEE THAT MANY PEOPLE ON THE
STREETS THERE.

00:05:15.581 --> 00:05:17.450
WE KNOW THERE'S A LOT OF
SUPPRESSION, BUT WE DON'T SEE

00:05:17.450 --> 00:05:24.690
THAT MANY PEOPLE EVEN AT THE
HEIGHT OF THEIR PROTEST AGAINST

00:05:24.690 --> 00:05:27.460
THE KREMLIN.
&gt;&gt; THE POINT IS, NAVALNY IS

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:30.096
STILL ALIVE.
SO PUTIN, IF HE WAS ALL

00:05:30.096 --> 00:05:35.101
POWERFUL, HE COULD HAVE HIM,
YOU KNOW, HE'S HIS GREAT

00:05:35.101 --> 00:05:36.769
ADVERSARY, NAVALNY, AND HE
STILL LIVE.

00:05:36.769 --> 00:05:39.939
THAT TO ME SUGGESTS WEAKNESS,
NOT STRENGTH.

00:05:39.939 --> 00:05:44.510
SECONDLY, HE HASN'T CALLED FOR
UNIVERSAL CONSCRIPTION.

00:05:44.510 --> 00:05:47.513
AGAIN, THE REASON FOR THAT IS
HE IS AFRAID THAT PEOPLE IN

00:05:47.513 --> 00:05:50.416
MOSCOW AND ST. PETERSBURG WILL
SAY, WHY ON EARTH ARE YOU

00:05:50.416 --> 00:05:53.319
SENDING MY 18-YEAR-OLD SON FOR
YOUR STUPID WAR?

00:05:53.319 --> 00:06:00.159
AND SO, TIME AND AGAIN I'VE
SEEN THIS, ON THE OUTSKIRTS OF

00:06:00.159 --> 00:06:04.464
BUCHA IN EARLY APRIL, THE
RUSSIAN SOLDIERS WE SAW WERE

00:06:04.464 --> 00:06:08.601
NOT ETHNIC RUSSIANS.
THERE WERE RUSSIAN MONGOLS.

00:06:08.601 --> 00:06:11.404
&gt;&gt; ETHNIC MINORITIES, RIGHT.
&gt;&gt; YES, EXACTLY.

00:06:11.404 --> 00:06:15.575
SO HE'S NOT USING, SO WHY IS
THAT?

00:06:15.575 --> 00:06:19.445
THE REASON, AGAIN I THINK, IS
BECAUSE HE'S AFRAID, BECAUSE IF

00:06:19.445 --> 00:06:22.581
HE CALLS FOR UNIVERSAL
CONSCRIPTION, MOMS AND DADS AND

00:06:22.581 --> 00:06:25.451
MOSCOW AND ST. PETERSBURG WILL
SAY, WE WILL PROTEST AGAINST

00:06:25.451 --> 00:06:27.453
YOU.
WE DON'T WANT OUR SONS TO GO TO

00:06:27.453 --> 00:06:29.589
WAR.
AND THERE IS A SERIES OF THINGS

00:06:29.589 --> 00:06:32.425
LIKE THIS.
I ALSO THINK THAT IF, FOR

00:06:32.425 --> 00:06:36.128
EXAMPLE, PUTIN HITS THE NUCLEAR
BUTTON, I DO NOT BELIEVE THAT

00:06:36.128 --> 00:06:39.165
PUTIN WILL WORK, BECAUSE I
THINK THE KREMLIN MACHINERY

00:06:39.165 --> 00:06:42.368
DOESN'T LIKE THIS WAR, AND IS
UNHAPPY WITH IT.

00:06:42.368 --> 00:06:49.308
WE ALSO HEAR THE GOSSIP, THE
CIA HAVE SAID TO THE RUSSIANS,

00:06:49.308 --> 00:06:53.479
IF YOU USE A TACTICAL NUCLEAR
WEAPON IN UKRAINE, THINGS WILL

00:06:53.479 --> 00:06:57.316
NOT GO WELL FOR YOU.
WHAT THEY SPECIFICALLY SAID IS,

00:06:57.316 --> 00:07:03.489
WE WILL TARGET RUSSIAN MILITARY
PLACES WITH MASSES OF

00:07:03.489 --> 00:07:09.095
CONVENTIONAL CRUISE MISSILES IN
A WAY THAT WILL HUMILIATE PUTIN

00:07:09.095 --> 00:07:13.399
AND THE RUSSIAN KILLING MACHINE
WITHOUT ESCALATING TO NUCLEAR.

00:07:13.399 --> 00:07:18.404
SO, WE ARE IN A GAME OF THREATS
WITH SOMEBODY, WHO I SAY IN MY

00:07:18.404 --> 00:07:20.873
BOOK, IS NOT JUST A KILLER,
HE'S A SERIAL KILLER.

00:07:20.873 --> 00:07:28.114
HE'S PATHOLOGICALLY ENTHRALL TO
VIOLENCE AND TO THREATS, AND HE

00:07:28.114 --> 00:07:29.815
THREATENS AGAIN AND AGAIN AND
AGAIN.

00:07:29.815 --> 00:07:32.151
AND IF WE GIVE HIM WHAT HE
WANTS, HE WILL ONLY ASK FOR

00:07:32.151 --> 00:07:33.586
MORE.
AND I THINK WHAT WE ARE LOOKING

00:07:33.586 --> 00:07:38.624
AT HERE WITH THE NUCLEAR STORY,
YES IT'S ALARMING, BUT AT THE

00:07:38.624 --> 00:07:40.826
SAME TIME IT'S PART OF HIS
PLAYBOOK.

00:07:40.826 --> 00:07:46.399
AND THE BEST WAY TO SEE THE END
OF THIS WAR IS TO GIVE THE

00:07:46.399 --> 00:07:49.402
UKRAINIAN ARMY AND UKRAINIAN
PEOPLE THE MONEY AND THE HEAVY

00:07:49.402 --> 00:07:51.037
METAL THEY NEED TO DEFEAT THE
RUSSIAN KILLING MACHINE.

00:07:51.037 --> 00:07:57.710
&gt;&gt; IT IS THE WAR, IN YOUR
OPINION, NOW AT AN INFLECTION

00:07:57.710 --> 00:07:59.845
POINT AS WE SEE CONTINUED
FIGHTING THERE?

00:07:59.845 --> 00:08:03.616
OBVIOUSLY, WE ARE SEEING
RUSSIAN OUT REGROUP IN THE EAST

00:08:03.616 --> 00:08:08.020
AND SENT SOME OF THEIR TROOPS
TO THE SOUTH THERE, AS UKRAINE

00:08:08.020 --> 00:08:11.857
IS TRYING TO RECLAIM SOME OF
THAT TERRITORY THAT RUSSIA HAS

00:08:11.857 --> 00:08:14.126
TAKEN, SPECIFICALLY AROUND
KHERSON.

00:08:14.126 --> 00:08:17.063
THERE HAVE BEEN ANALYSTS THAT
SAY PERHAPS NOW WITH THE HIGH

00:08:17.063 --> 00:08:20.066
MARS AND THE ADDITIONAL SUPPORT,
BOTH FINANCIALLY AND MILITARILY

00:08:20.066 --> 00:08:23.603
FROM THE UNITED STATES, THAT
THIS LARGELY IS IN AN

00:08:23.603 --> 00:08:25.705
INFLECTION POINT, A TURNING
POINT, FOR THE UKRAINIANS.

00:08:25.705 --> 00:08:30.176
DO YOU AGREE?
&gt;&gt; I THINK THERE WILL BE ONE

00:08:30.176 --> 00:08:35.014
SOON, BUT I ALSO THINK THE
AMERICANS ARE SUPPLYING

00:08:35.014 --> 00:08:39.352
UKRAINIANS WITH THE AMMUNITION
AND BIG LONG GUNS.

00:08:39.352 --> 00:08:44.290
THE PRICE OF THAT IS THE
AMERICANS ARE SAYING TO

00:08:44.290 --> 00:08:48.227
UKRAINIANS, PLEASE DO AS WE ASK
YOU TO DO.

00:08:48.227 --> 00:08:50.930
THE UKRAINIANS ARE COMPLYING,
PARTLY BECAUSE THEY HAVE NO

00:08:50.930 --> 00:08:55.234
CHOICE, BUT THE AMERICAN POLICY
ON THIS IS SOFTLY, SOFTLY.

00:08:55.234 --> 00:09:00.039
WHAT THEY ARE TRYING TO DO, I
MEAN, I THINK THE OTHER DAY

00:09:00.039 --> 00:09:03.175
THEY ANNOUNCED A BILLION
DOLLARS IN DEFENSE AID, BUT

00:09:03.175 --> 00:09:05.277
NORMALLY IT'S LESS THAN THAT.
700 MILLION.

00:09:05.277 --> 00:09:08.414
THEY ARE SAYING TO THE
UKRAINIANS, YOU CAN'T HAVE OUR

00:09:08.414 --> 00:09:12.385
BEST JETS, OUR BEST TANKS, OUR
BEST ARMORED PERSONNEL

00:09:12.385 --> 00:09:14.253
CARRIERS.
THAT IS A DELIBERATE POLICY.

00:09:14.253 --> 00:09:22.961
WHAT THEY ARE TRYING TO DO IS
TO PREVENT PUTIN FROM SEEING

00:09:22.961 --> 00:09:25.297
ONE SINGLE PIECE OF AID OR KIT
AS SOMETHING THAT WHICH WILL

00:09:25.297 --> 00:09:28.267
ALLOW HIM TO ESCALATE TO A NEW
THRESHOLD OF VIOLENCE.

00:09:28.267 --> 00:09:31.737
THAT'S A DELIBERATE AMERICAN
POLICY IF YOU STUDY IT.

00:09:31.737 --> 00:09:34.974
I DON'T NECESSARILY AGREE WITH
IT, I JUST THINK THE FASTER YOU

00:09:34.974 --> 00:09:39.611
DESTROYED THE RUSSIAN KILLING
MACHINE, THE FASTER PUTIN WILL

00:09:39.611 --> 00:09:45.551
BE IN TROUBLE, AND THEN WE CAN
HOPE THERE IS A NEW RUSSIA AND

00:09:45.551 --> 00:09:49.422
SOMEONE FAR BETTER.
LET'S HOPE SO, BUT THE

00:09:49.422 --> 00:09:54.393
AMERICANS POLICY IS CONSISTENT,
AND I THINK, SMART.

00:09:54.393 --> 00:09:59.465
SO WHAT THEY ARE DOING IS
MAKING IT MUCH MORE DIFFICULT.

00:09:59.465 --> 00:10:03.536
WHAT IT IS IS THEY ARE BOILING
THE RUSSIAN FROG SLOWLY.

00:10:03.536 --> 00:10:05.838
THEY ARE NOT DUMPING THE FROG
IN THE HEAT.

00:10:05.838 --> 00:10:08.708
THEY ARE SLOWLY TURNING UP THE
HEAT AGAIN AND AGAIN AND AGAIN.

00:10:08.708 --> 00:10:15.548
AT SOME POINT, THE UKRAINIANS
WILL GET KHERSON.

00:10:15.548 --> 00:10:18.451
I THINK THEY WILL GET IT BACK
AND THEN MOVE TO THE EAST AND

00:10:18.451 --> 00:10:21.187
MOVE SOUTH.
I SAY THIS BECAUSE I KNOW MY

00:10:21.187 --> 00:10:24.790
UKRAINIAN FRIENDS, THEIR SPIRIT
IS SO HIGH.

00:10:24.790 --> 00:10:27.626
THEIR MORALE IS SO HIGH
COMPARED TO THE RUSSIANS.

00:10:27.626 --> 00:10:30.596
&gt;&gt; WELL, THERE'S ANOTHER
MISCALCULATION AS WE CLOSE HERE

00:10:30.596 --> 00:10:32.131
ON VLADIMIR PUTIN'S PART AS
WELL.

00:10:32.131 --> 00:10:34.734
HE THOUGHT HE WOULD GET GIVE IN
THREE DAYS AND HERE WE ARE SIX

00:10:34.734 --> 00:10:35.901
MONTHS LATER.
&gt;&gt; YEAH.

00:10:35.901 --> 00:10:39.739
SO THE LONGER THE WAR, THE
WORSE IT IS FOR VLADIMIR PUTIN.

00:10:39.739 --> 00:10:43.809
HE'S A FRAGILE MONSTER.
&gt;&gt; WE WILL HAVE TO LEAVE IT

00:10:43.809 --> 00:10:46.545
THERE, JOHN SWEENEY.
THANK YOU SO MUCH, WE

00:10:46.545 --> 00:10:47.413
APPRECIATE YOUR TIME.

